# A wand of curse (a small wand, 106, with curse: a spell for a character or an object, offensive) zapped at a
# character checks fight.c's is_safe_spell: Decimus is in no clan, so each zap is refused ("Somehting isn't
# right...", sic). In the temple (3001): Pickpocket (13, wands at 75%) and Decimus. The wand has five charges, as the rolls can fail.
@connect pick
Pickpocket
psswrd
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as pick
@obj 106 3001 5 5 5 29 0
get wand
hold wand
zap decimus
@pulse 24
zap decimus
@pulse 24
zap decimus
@pulse 24
zap decimus
@pulse 24
zap decimus
